{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-17_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-17","title":"晶簇之内","storyCode":"14-19","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-17_beg.txt","sourceHash":"753f965a70fd306436fa2d2df3abab99126eaf93aecdf2f8487de38ce81c4022","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"你可能记不清今天对你来说，究竟意味着什么。\n这会让你陷入十分危险的处境。\n......\n不。\n你必须想起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......状态......正常......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又让你受苦了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，抓紧我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下次请不要再一声不吭地离开我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也不会再接受这种事了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......怎么了，Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么用这么陌生的眼神看着我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（“未知语言”）普瑞......赛斯......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你又从哪里学来了这么奇怪的语言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这次休眠你又偷偷将思维上传到某个旋臂末端的文明中了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，再确认一下你的语言功能恢复得如何吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"别说你睡了一场大觉，连我的名字都忘记了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"来，再叫一次我的名字，数据库会分析你的所有声音数据。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞......赛斯......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"恢复得很快嘛，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你的身体刚刚复苏，还没有完全适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"急着乱动的话，小心NX-07把你按回床铺哦。它新换的指令很难解开，就连我都爱莫能助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你......我在哪里？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"当然还在“罗德岛”，我们的家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只有......我一个人？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会只有你呢？我也在这里呀。"}]},{"label":"罗德岛的......其他人呢......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然还是会这样问。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"变故发生得很快。防御矩阵损伤超过了百分之九十，受极端环境影响，修理单元也很难在短时间内恢复工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"在你休眠后不久，许多同事就相继离开了这里......大家都很珍惜这星星坠落之前的时间，我很理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，的确只有我们两个了。当然，AMa-10也还在，而且精神很好，很活泼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，罗德岛剩下的部分还可以维系基本功能，我们还有一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，你在我身边的时候，我并不害怕结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是构成我们身体的物质崩毁，我们的意识停止变化，还是宇宙的法则颠倒，我都可以坦然接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你还在我身边就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在出神，是还没有从梦里醒来吗，{@nickname}？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她握着你的手，贴在了自己的脸颊上。\n肌肤的触感温暖而真实，将你从梦里拉回现实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是这样，我想知道你的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，里面最好有我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......梦吗......？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"......很长的梦吗......？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_9_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"“泰拉”。\n那片大地......天灾......矿石病......\n可你已经漫步在那片大地上数年，一切都如此真实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_15"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群的欢呼依旧在你的耳边回荡。\n天灾不曾摧毁希望，在苦难的创伤之下，你依旧可触碰那恒久的余温。\n温暖的。动人的。你被簇拥在温柔的人群之中......\n“罗德岛”。\n你永远不会忘记的罗德岛。\n治愈过你伤痕的罗德岛......曾留下过遗憾的罗德岛......\n你不是依旧站在这里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"和他们一起，你去过冰雪覆盖之地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也感受过沙滩的柔软。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"见证他们活着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"46_i01"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"见证他们离去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_13"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们使你确信——\n在本该被焚尽的不公之地......理想亦应是信念。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G08"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陪伴理想主义者跨越热浪，无论是否被热浪灼伤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到帝国的龌龊，也感受到无力反抗命运的悲凉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你不会忘记......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts"},{"type":"narration","text":"——她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她从未离开你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_0_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"她们都从未离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“博士......”\n“博士！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（“未知语言”）阿米娅......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你走神啦，嘴里又开始念叨这些不属于我们的语言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那些经历......很真实。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那不是梦。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是很正常吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"定义梦和现实的权力，一直都握于我们掌中，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"当我们的思维在寰宇中穿梭亿万光年，参加那些于冰冻旷野中向白矮星祭拜生命的仪式时，我们如何定义这等体验呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"等你的思维回到这副躯体后，你又如何分辨亿万年后才会被捕获的信息是梦还是现实？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你该不会真的在思考这件事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞赛斯......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，{@nickname}？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我不曾见过你，可为何你的名字，我却能脱口而出？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾见过......你还是发现了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我很高兴听到你这么说，这意味着你距离找到真正的我，已经很近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还是忍不住有些失望呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"因为那个小小的意外，你的记忆......的确受到了无法逆转的损伤，就连我也无能为力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里......也是罗德岛？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我以前来过这里吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这里嘛......“不可知”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起建造这个地方的时候，曾经许下过一个共同的愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"等到群星的最后一丝温热消散，时间的路网完全陷入混乱的那一天，就让黑暗成为我们共同的被子吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......听起来很像一座坟墓。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"等到这个世界，这片星空迎来最后的时刻......我们的宇宙本来就会变成一座巨大的坟墓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"没有任何一颗星球的角落里藏着希望。但凡有一颗宇宙碎片的微粒上藏着救赎的答案，它也一定已经被我们打捞起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次的反抗都以提前毁灭告终，每一次的探索都只会带来更深重的绝望......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"结论是那么简单。任何以正常物质为基础的生命形式都无法逃离。任何一种可知的技术，都无法战胜那绝对的终结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，很久没有机会向你倾诉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们的关系......很亲密？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"亲密？我不会用这种词语来形容我们之间的关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这是对我们过去所经历的一切的贬低。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我并不记得。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我并不生气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你的大脑不再记得，你的意识深处，那些任何仪器都无法捕捉到的地方......一定还留存着我的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的话......你怎么会任由我像这样，一直拉着你的手呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"嗯......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"过去我们也常常这么做吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"“牵手”——嗯，我们有很多种不同方式的“牵手”。很多时候并不需要借助躯体的某些具体部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我们第一次见面的时候......我正在环绕着一颗海洋星球飞行。我把恒星当作不变的锚，沿着昼夜分界线，飞了一圈又一圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"恒星的死亡来得很快。我身下的海洋几乎在一瞬间离解了，露出了星球赤裸的暗红色脊骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"有人从身后拉住了我，把我拽到了一处更安静的星云里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"那个人向我解释，知道我很可能不会有危险，但那个人来不及确认我的本体在哪个星场中，只能用自己的船打捞了我的意识信标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我第一次登上那艘卵形的船。它并不大，可是很灵活，已经去过无数个星系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我把船带到了一颗并不算热闹的行星上。我向船的主人展示了我面向大海的小实验室，并且走到了那个人的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"就像这样......我握住了对方的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"“我叫普瑞赛斯，语言学家。我正在研究行星死去时发出的最后声波。我喜欢安静地独处，但也想和合适的人一起探索宇宙。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"该你啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我？自我介绍吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我是......{@nickname}。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊，我们又认识了一回呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你当时也有些犹豫。在那个时代......人们已经越来越少像这样亲密相处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"好在，我们是同类。你无私地向我分享了你的旅行见闻，并对我发起了邀请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我们跳跃在时间与空间之中，去往宇宙的各个角落。有时是乘坐着你的船，更多时候是通过意识穿梭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你向我描绘不同文明的兴衰迭起、隐藏在群星诞生与毁灭中的规律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的思维在相互碰撞中无限迭代，直至驻足回首时才发现，我们已经超越了其他人太多太多......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的手中翻转出一枚无比纯净的晶体。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......源石。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我们争论与碰撞的结晶，凝结了无数先驱守望宇宙时留下的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"它是如此美丽......"},{"type":"narration","text":"她将源石轻轻地放在了你的手中，握住你的手，共同捧起这美轮美奂的造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都说，我是那个创造了源石与未来，像“神明”一般的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"但我一直都知道，真正的天才是你，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘记了......但你不该忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"在创造它的路上，我不断地追赶你的脚步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我害怕在某一次与你辩论时掉队，害怕让你发现我本不如你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"不，或许你发现了......也许你也曾放慢脚步等我，等待我追上你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"可现在，我永远都不会知道答案了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你......很在意？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"在意，但我接受这个事实。倒不如说，这让我喜悦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"你依旧藏着许多令我着迷的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，对你而言，现在的我同样如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"难道不是吗，{@nickname}？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我......的确还有很多的困惑。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"那就继续在这个地方寻找答案吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们共同的造物，共同的过去，也藏着我们共同的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你和我同行——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"抱歉，但现在我有更在意的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我必须先确认更重要的事。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想和你分享一些我一直替你保存的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"那些你曾向我描绘，如今你自己却已全然忘记的理念和愿景......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我想让你知道我们所取得的成就。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"也许这样，你能想起过去，想起我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"但我能看见你所想，我能感受你所思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"就像此刻，你的脑海中依旧萦绕着无穷的疑惑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿米娅”“凯尔希”——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_083","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不想让你为难，我尊重你的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的手触碰到了黑暗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我很确信......{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当你真正对一切感到困惑的时候，你会想起——答案一直都在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
